exports[`mixed-direction transactional mail > isolates a mixed poll title and leaves the voting and opt-out URLs in their original order 1`] = `
{
  "html": "<p>Use your private link to take part in <bdi>📅 42 مراجعة (Review) &amp; צוות</bdi>.<br><a href="https://calendar.example.test/poll/voter#vvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvv" rel="noreferrer"><bdi dir="ltr">https://calendar.example.test/poll/voter#vvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvv</bdi></a></p>
<p>Stop reminder emails for this poll.<br><a href="https://calendar.example.test/poll/reminder-opt-out#ooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooo" rel="noreferrer"><bdi dir="ltr">https://calendar.example.test/poll/reminder-opt-out#ooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooo</bdi></a></p>",
  "subject": "View meeting poll: 📅 42 مراجعة (Review) & צוות",
  "text": "Hourmere

Use your private link to take part in 📅 42 مراجعة (Review) & צוות.
https://calendar.example.test/poll/voter#vvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvv

This link is valid until Saturday, November 21, 2026 at 10:00 AM (UTC).

Opening this link does not confirm your email or submit a vote.

Stop reminder emails for this poll.
https://calendar.example.test/poll/reminder-opt-out#ooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooo
",
}
`;

exports[`mixed-direction transactional mail > keeps a mixed waitlist title and escaped verification URL intact in both alternatives 1`] = `
{
  "html": "<p>请确认此邮箱，以加入<span class="cjk-quote">“</span><bdi>📅 42 مراجعة (Review) &amp; צוות</bdi><span class="cjk-quote">”</span>的候补名单。仅打开链接不会确认申请。</p>
<p>请打开链接，然后在页面上确认：<br><a href="https://calendar.example.test/booking/waitlist/verify#token=019a278e-3ff2-7a91-8fe0-1846a52d0b22.vvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvv&amp;management=019a278e-3ff2-7a91-8fe0-1846a52d0b22.mmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmm" rel="noreferrer"><bdi dir="ltr">https://calendar.example.test/booking/waitlist/verify#token=019a278e-3ff2-7a91-8fe0-1846a52d0b22.vvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvv&amp;management=019a278e-3ff2-7a91-8fe0-1846a52d0b22.mmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmm</bdi></a></p>
<p>如需退出候补名单，请打开以下链接并确认退出：<br><a href="https://calendar.example.test/booking/waitlist/remove#019a278e-3ff2-7a91-8fe0-1846a52d0b22.mmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmm" rel="noreferrer"><bdi dir="ltr">https://calendar.example.test/booking/waitlist/remove#019a278e-3ff2-7a91-8fe0-1846a52d0b22.mmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmm</bdi></a></p>",
  "subject": "确认候补申请：📅 42 مراجعة (Review) & צוות",
  "text": "Hourmere

请确认此邮箱，以加入“📅 42 مراجعة (Review) & צוות”的候补名单。仅打开链接不会确认申请。

请打开链接，然后在页面上确认：
https://calendar.example.test/booking/waitlist/verify#token=019a278e-3ff2-7a91-8fe0-1846a52d0b22.vvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvv&management=019a278e-3ff2-7a91-8fe0-1846a52d0b22.mmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmm

此验证链接将于 2026年11月21日星期六 10:00（UTC，GMT+00:00） 过期，最迟在提交申请后 30 分钟失效。

建议时段会提供给所有符合条件的候补者。不会为任何人预留时段；以最先成功完成的预约为准。部分邮件可能无法送达或延迟送达。

如需退出候补名单，请打开以下链接并确认退出：
https://calendar.example.test/booking/waitlist/remove#019a278e-3ff2-7a91-8fe0-1846a52d0b22.mmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmm

如果你没有提交此申请，可以忽略本邮件，或通过上方链接撤销申请。
",
}
`;

